UI-E2E-UIFOUNDATION-TRADEBLOTTER-DATAGRID-001
    [Documentation]  CHECK TRADE DATADRID
    ...  control the impact to the filter funciton on the main data table in trade blotter
    [Tags]  TRADEREVIEW  TRADEBLOTTER  E2E  UIFOUNDATION
        # Open Browser1
    Login RatanOne and Goto Tile  
    ...  username=${USERNAME_FMO_MO_TV}  
    ...  password=${PASSWORD_FMO_MO_TV}  
    ...  tile="Trade Blotter" >> nth=0
    ${handler_1st}  GetHandler

    # Waiting for Page Load
    Wait For Elements State  selector=${_common_currentTab} >> "Search"
    Waiting for Element Hidden  selector="Please wait..."

    # Trigget Deafault Search
    Browser.Click  selector=${_common_currentTab} >> "Search"
    Waiting for Element Hidden  selector="loading..."
    
    # Click 1st Filter Button
    Browser.Click  .ag-header-cell-filter-button >> nth=0

    # Excpect count of .ag-virtual-list-item .ag-filter-virtual-list-item > 0
    ${list}  Get Elements  .ag-filter-virtual-list-item
    ${len}  Get Length  ${list}
    Should Be True  ${len} >= 2
